# Run from pre-commit instead, this froze the machine whenever several worktrees committed at once.
# A run-many over every project here re-ran the whole workspace on each push after a merge from
# origin. `affected` diffs from the merge-base with `defaultBase` in nx.json, and adds the
# uncommitted and untracked files.
#
# `test` is left to the pull-request gate, which runs it over the same projects on a clean checkout
# and holds the merge. Here it ran on every push, on a machine the other worktrees were pushing from
# too.
pnpm nx affected -t lint typecheck build
